Tiller is a local-first command deck runtime for ACP coding agents.

This repository includes first-party workspace packages under apps/ and
packages/. Runtime builds may bundle first-party workspace code and the Deck
static assets into the @qianshe/tiller npm package.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. Review package manifests
and lockfiles before publishing a release artifact.

Tiller Pro, hosted services, commercial support and enterprise control-plane
features may be distributed separately under commercial terms.
